.venv/
# This repo is PUBLIC and no longer publishes results. Runs, summaries, rendered
# dashboards, plans and learnings live in the private companion repo
# (sovren-ai-benchmark-locals). Commit 1d69dbc made that split; these rules keep it.
# Only sample.json stays, because the dashboard template needs demo data to render.
results/*
!results/sample.json

# Per-machine measurement, same category as config.yaml: whoever runs the harness
# generates their own with tools/measure_context_perf.py. Not a harness artefact.
data/context_perf.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
.datasets_ready
config.yaml
config-eh*

docs_steering/

lib/
lib64/
data/spider/

# BFCL v4 dataset, extracted from the bfcl-eval wheel by prefetch_datasets.py
data/bfcl_v4/
